Package: ooastdiff
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: AST & SYNTAX DIFFER
 Programming language AST differ ignoring cosmetic whitespace and comment changes.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 semantic token diffing, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
